  "description": "Starting points for Patina for mixing down and mastering in many music styles and situations: club, festival, big room, home hi-fi, headphones, studio reference, radio and car, plus 32 music styles for streaming. Every preset sets its own character, drive, mix, colour, brightness and low protection: tube or tape for energetic styles with a firm protected low end, soft and light for classical and ambient, dark and dirty for lo-fi. A situation adds its own correction to the style (for example more drive for a festival, a gentler top for headphones, less low protection for small radio and car speakers), and the output trim is set per preset so the level stays close to the original.",
